{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284280","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028428001:1":{"text":"ここは……えっと……あ、あなたたちは？","source_cn":"我……呃……你们，你们是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1D401FE8F7F71E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028428002:1":{"text":"怖がらなくても大丈夫です！悪い人間ではありません！ブラックゴールドの悪人は倒しましたよ。見てください！","source_cn":"不要害怕，我们是好人！我们把那个黑金的坏人打败了，你看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x825C7127E70294F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028428003:1":{"text":"ミサタ様……ありがとうございます……","source_cn":"弥萨忒在上……幸好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x480CCC7457053469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028428004:1":{"text":"お願いです！私の子どもを助けてください！この男にさらわれたのです！","source_cn":"求你们救救我的孩子！他把我的孩子绑走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x004E43A78F468499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028428005:1":{"text":"安心してください。すでに白状しました。お子さんは、ヴィジランツが無事に家まで送り届けます。","source_cn":"放心，刚才他都交代了，我会让巡游队平安送你的孩子回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBEE07E1378B2E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028428005":{"text":"安心してください。すでに白状しました。お子さんは、ヴィジランツが無事に家まで送り届けます。","source_cn":"放心，刚才他都交代了，我会让巡游队平安送你的孩子回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBEE07E1378B2E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028428006:1":{"text":"あ……あの男に脅されて森で研究をしていました。魔術かなにかでヴェルディア連盟のメンバーになりすまし、茨の護衛隊の封鎖をすり抜けて、捜査をしていたのです。","source_cn":"我……我被他胁迫去林场做研究。他好像用了什么法术，伪装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C5AC98832A228D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028428007:3":{"text":"研究を始めてほどなくして、採集部隊がやってきました。それで我々の計画は台無しになりました。","source_cn":"研究开始没过多久，采集队的人来了，一下子打乱了我们的计划。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FE2FEBB3D9BD85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028428008:1":{"text":"その隙に逃げて、森の破壊を食い止めよう。私はそう考えました！ですが奴は子どもを盾に……私を連れてこの洞窟に身を隠したのです。採集部隊がいなくなったら、実験を再開すると言って。","source_cn":"我本来想趁机离开，停止对林场的破坏！可他用孩子威胁……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9FD32B1265991A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028428009:1":{"text":"私は反対しました。ですがもみ合った末に、殴られて気を失ってしまったのです……","source_cn":"我想反抗，但在争斗中，反而被他打晕了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ECF83FAD5B821A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028428010:1":{"text":"――そうだ！採集部隊の隊員たち！彼らは大丈夫ですか！？","source_cn":"——对了！那些采集队员！他们的身体怎么样了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBB33BC56AFB73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1028428010":{"text":"――そうだ！採集部隊の隊員たち！彼らは大丈夫ですか！？","source_cn":"——对了！那些采集队员！他们的身体怎么样了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBB33BC56AFB73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028428011:0":{"text":"それならよかった……みなさんのおかげです。","source_cn":"这就好……多亏有你们在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AA58CA541C056E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028428012:0":{"text":"ですが、森が腐敗され、周辺の薬草も影響を受けているはずです。完治させることはできないでしょう。","source_cn":"嗯，林场被腐化后，恐怕附近的药草也受到部分影响，无法完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x043687A042AA9738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028428015:2":{"text":"これをどうぞ！これは森が腐敗される前に、こっそりと採集して配合した<style=\"highlight\">解毒剤</style>です……これで採集部隊の隊員たちは助かるはずです。","source_cn":"收下吧，这是我在林场被腐化之前，偷偷采集配置的<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12FD403617305D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028428016:1":{"text":"……すべては私の責任です。私はなんということをしてしまったんだ。森をこんな姿に……！！","source_cn":"……都是我的错，我都做了什么啊，把森林破坏成那个样子……！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47814D90D25DBCCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028428017:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません！どうか許してください……どうか！！","source_cn":"对不起，请原谅我……请原谅我！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214B2A8FEA6274C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1028428017":{"text":"申し訳ありません！どうか許してください……どうか！！","source_cn":"对不起，请原谅我……请原谅我！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214B2A8FEA6274C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028428018:0":{"text":"マスターがこう言っているのですから、大丈夫です！安心してください。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x01B1F01CD2E18B54","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスターがこう言っているのですから、大丈夫です！安心してください。","female":"マスターがこう言っているのですから、大丈夫です！安心してください。","variant_male_record_index":"113359","variant_female_record_index":"113360","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028428019:1":{"text":"誰かが意図的に実験を再開しないかぎり、状況がこれ以上悪化することはないでしょう。森の豊かな生命力とマスターの魔法があれば、これくらいの腐敗は浄化できます！","source_cn":"只要没有人为推动，情况就不会继续恶化，丛林旺盛的生命力...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x39272D940E47BD20","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"誰かが意図的に実験を再開しないかぎり、状況がこれ以上悪化することはないでしょう。森の豊かな生命力とマスターの魔法があれば、これくらいの腐敗は浄化できます！","female":"誰かが意図的に実験を再開しないかぎり、状況がこれ以上悪化することはないでしょう。森の豊かな生命力とマスターの魔法があれば、これくらいの腐敗は浄化できます！","variant_male_record_index":"113361","variant_female_record_index":"113362","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028428020:1":{"text":"そうですよ。そんなに自分を責める必要はありません。ブラックゴールド商会に脅迫されてやったことなのですから。","source_cn":"嗯，请您别太自责，毕竟您也受到了黑金商会的胁迫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CFC3AE5FCD25F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028428021:1":{"text":"我々の故郷を信じましょう。我々が暮らす場所には、いつもみなぎる活気と力強い生命にあふれている。そうですよね？","source_cn":"相信我们的家园吧，我们生活的地方，始终充满了勃勃的生机...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x772D665DBFF5B1F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1028428022:1":{"text":"そのとおりです。我々の森はとても偉大です……","source_cn":"你说得对，我们有一片伟大的森林……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC71E4BBAF64997CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1028428023:1":{"text":"それではヴィジランツの到着を待ちましょう。我々はまだやらなければならないことがあります。","source_cn":"那么，接下来就等巡游队的队员赶到吧。我们还有事要处理呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCC083FAFF3983E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:26:1028428024:1":{"text":"すぐにヴィジランツの隊員たちが到着した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99DC05C5935B60F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028428025:1":{"text":"この二人をお願いします。そうだ。こちらブラックゴールド商会の「植物学者」には注意してくださいね。しっかりと縄を絞めておくように！","source_cn":"把他们带走吧。对了，记得把这位黑金商会的“植物学家”看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B096C16A0CAD4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028428026:1":{"text":"はい！ライカ隊長！","source_cn":"是！莱卡队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7F7A5B042CB0DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1028428027:1":{"text":"学者さん、心配しないでください。お子さんは必ず送り届けます。ですが……","source_cn":"学者先生，请放心吧，他们一定会把你的孩子送回家的。但你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A66348A19E7A83A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1028428028:1":{"text":"はい……分かっています。自分がしたことの責任を取って、きちんと罪を償います……","source_cn":"我……我知道，我会承担应该承担的责任，想办法弥补我犯的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B6F381BDE8BEED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1028428029:1":{"text":"すみませんでした……そして、ありがとうございました。","source_cn":"对不起……谢谢你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39DEBD5E6A061F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"すぐに中断したことが幸いだった。","source_cn":"你们收手得很及时","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD501EE122B81BAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"すぐに中断したことが幸いだった。","female":"すぐに中断したことが幸いだったわ。","variant_male_record_index":"61890","variant_female_record_index":"61891","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"幸い腐敗はそれほど酷くない。","source_cn":"幸好那些腐化并不严重","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48F370CCBE59E737","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"幸い腐敗はそれほど酷くない。","female":"幸い腐敗はそれほど酷くない。","variant_male_record_index":"61892","variant_female_record_index":"61893","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"なんとか症状は抑え込んでいる。","source_cn":"我们想办法缓解了症状","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEC05FF7042A01393","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"なんとか症状は抑え込んでいる。","female":"なんとか症状は抑え込んでいる。","variant_male_record_index":"61886","variant_female_record_index":"61887","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1028428013:1":{"text":"薬草を探してきました！ですが症状を抑えているだけで、完全に治すことはできていません。","source_cn":"我们给他们找了药草！不过只能缓解他们的症状，没法彻底治愈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67D22A0DFE016F8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1028428014:0":{"text":"とはいえ、随分と良くなったようでした。","source_cn":"不过，他们看起来已经好一些了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8316A09FE033061A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"まだ完全には回復していない。","source_cn":"还没有彻底恢复","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2871E45696E493C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まだ完全には回復していない。","female":"まだ完全には回復していない。","variant_male_record_index":"61888","variant_female_record_index":"61889","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"話してくれ。何があったんだ？","source_cn":"说说吧，怎么回事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x71E60538D4081A81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"話してくれ。何があったんだ？","female":"話してちょうだい。何があったの？","variant_male_record_index":"61884","variant_female_record_index":"61885","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:植物学家达利恩":{"text":"植物学者のダリエン","source":"植物学家达利恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:薄暮巡游队员":{"text":"ヴィジランツ","source":"薄暮巡游队员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":38,"localized_text_count":37,"speaker_count":5}}